WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:07.730 --> 00:00:09.190
Hey Thoughty2 here.

00:00:09.190 --> 00:00:14.440
You may be surprised but McDonald's is no
longer the world's biggest restaurant chain,

00:00:14.440 --> 00:00:19.930
Subway is, with 7,000 more locations worldwide
than McDonald's.

00:00:19.930 --> 00:00:24.000
McDonald's have 31,000 restaurants internationally.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:28.099
McDonald's has more customer's daily than
the entire population of Great Britain, they

00:00:28.099 --> 00:00:35.070
serve over 68 million people every day, that's
about 1% of the world's population.

00:00:35.070 --> 00:00:41.280
McDonald's serves 75 hamburgers every second
and was one of the few businesses that grew

00:00:41.280 --> 00:00:43.250
throughout the recession.

00:00:43.250 --> 00:00:50.180
McDonald's $27.5 billion yearly revenue makes
it the 90th-largest economy in the world.

00:00:50.180 --> 00:00:56.579
McDonald's has 761,000 employees worldwide,
more than the entire population of Luxembourg.

00:00:56.579 --> 00:01:02.130
It is estimated that 1 in every 8 American
workers has been employed by McDonald's.

00:01:02.130 --> 00:01:07.160
In fact many celebrities worked at McDonald's
before they became famous, including Rachel

00:01:07.160 --> 00:01:12.550
McAdams, Sharon Stone, Shania Twain, Jay Leno,
Pink and James Franco.

00:01:12.550 --> 00:01:19.340
McDonald's is the world's largest distributor
of toys, with one included in 20% of all sales.

00:01:19.340 --> 00:01:27.140
Between 2011 and 2013 McDonald's plans to
open one restaurant every day in China.

00:01:27.140 --> 00:01:32.610
In the continental US you are never more than
107 miles away from a McDonald's.

00:01:32.610 --> 00:01:38.000
The farthest spot away from a McDonalds in
the US lies in the grasslands of South Dakota,

00:01:38.000 --> 00:01:41.370
between two tiny hamlets, called Meadow and
Glad Valley.

00:01:41.370 --> 00:01:48.990
At this spot you are 107 miles or at least
a 2 hour car journey away from a McDonald's.

00:01:48.990 --> 00:01:54.890
Americans alone consume an artery-busting,
one billion pounds of beef at McDonald's every

00:01:54.890 --> 00:01:55.890
year.

00:01:55.890 --> 00:01:57.980
That's 5.5 million cattle.

00:01:57.980 --> 00:02:03.630
The ominous McDonald's golden arches are recognised
by more people internationally than the cross.

00:02:03.630 --> 00:02:10.539
A survey found that 88% of people could identify
the arches, but only 54% recognised the Christian

00:02:10.539 --> 00:02:11.550
cross.

00:02:11.550 --> 00:02:15.190
There are 10 countries where you won't find
a single McDonald's.

00:02:15.190 --> 00:02:16.569
These are:
North Korea

00:02:16.569 --> 00:02:18.180
The Seychelles
Syria

00:02:18.180 --> 00:02:20.189
The Vatican City
Cambodia

00:02:20.189 --> 00:02:21.890
Zimbabwe
Vietnam

00:02:21.890 --> 00:02:24.950
Nepal
Kazakhstan, which is the largest country in

00:02:24.950 --> 00:02:26.879
the world to be McDonald's free.

00:02:26.879 --> 00:02:29.090
and finally Barbados.

00:02:29.090 --> 00:02:31.510
McDonald's sells unique items in every country.

00:02:31.510 --> 00:02:36.780
Did you know in Portugal you can order soup
at Mcdonald's and in India where the majority

00:02:36.780 --> 00:02:39.239
of the population doesn't eat beef.

00:02:39.239 --> 00:02:44.360
McDonald's serve meals such as the Chicken
Maharaja Mac and the Potato-Patty McAloo Tikki

00:02:44.360 --> 00:02:45.360
Burger.

00:02:45.360 --> 00:02:48.579
In Hong Kong you can order a Red Bean Pie
for dessert.

00:02:48.579 --> 00:02:52.690
In France they sell a burger on a stone oven-baked
ciabatta roll.

00:02:52.690 --> 00:02:58.609
Pulp Fiction fans will be happy to hear that,
yes you can buy a beer in McDonald's in France,

00:02:58.609 --> 00:03:01.170
the Netherlands, Germany and Austria.

00:03:01.170 --> 00:03:05.459
And all across Europe you can order a Royal
with Cheese.

00:03:05.459 --> 00:03:09.030
McDonald's is the single largest owner of
real estate in the world.

00:03:09.030 --> 00:03:13.590
They actually make the majority of their revenue
from the rent payed to them from their franchise

00:03:13.590 --> 00:03:14.590
owners.

00:03:14.590 --> 00:03:19.719
McDonald's paid rappers to mention Big Macs
in their songs to appeal more to young people.

00:03:19.719 --> 00:03:25.359
Hip Hop artists were paid about $5 every time
one of their songs with Big Mac in the lyrics

00:03:25.359 --> 00:03:26.359
played in the US.

00:03:26.359 --> 00:03:29.810
But where in the world will you pay the most
for a Big Mac?

00:03:29.810 --> 00:03:30.810
Norway.

00:03:30.810 --> 00:03:36.109
In Norway you'll pay the equivalent of $23
US Dollars for a single McDonald's meal of

00:03:36.109 --> 00:03:38.550
a Big Mac, soda and fries.

00:03:38.550 --> 00:03:42.310
In Hong Kong McDonald's has wedding packages
on its menu.

00:03:42.310 --> 00:03:45.599
Yes you can actually get married at McDonald's.

00:03:45.599 --> 00:03:49.329
Hamburgers and chicken nuggets aren't that
profitable, one of the most profitable items

00:03:49.329 --> 00:03:51.989
on McDonald's menu is soft drinks.

00:03:51.989 --> 00:03:54.430
McDonald's is the world's biggest retailer
of Coca-Cola.

00:03:54.430 --> 00:03:58.209
But the Coke sold at McDonald's isn't your
traditional soda.

00:03:58.209 --> 00:04:03.840
Most fast food chains buy Coca-Cola syrup
for about 53 pence per litre.

00:04:03.840 --> 00:04:05.909
They add the syrup to carbonated water.

00:04:05.909 --> 00:04:12.329
A medium Coke that sells for 75 pence only
contains 5 pence worth of syrup.

00:04:12.329 --> 00:04:18.370
Buying a large coke for 85 pence costs the
retailer another 2 pence worth of syrup.

00:04:18.370 --> 00:04:25.530
And last but least, McDonald's apple pies
are the hottest substance known to man.

